MODULE: SupersedeKeepsRevision
TARGET: RevisionAdvances
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a later alias publication leaves cached map revisions unchanged
PERTURBS: Supersede

--- FIND
        /\ map' = [map EXCEPT ![l] = p]
        /\ version' = [version EXCEPT ![l] = @ + 1]
--- REPLACE
        /\ map' = [map EXCEPT ![l] = p]
        /\ version' = version
--- END
